---
import ContentPageLayout from '../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';

---
<ContentPageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How MiniAdda handles your data, cookies and analytics."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  crumb="Privacy Policy"
>
  <p>
    MiniAdda is built to be lightweight. We aim to collect as little personal data as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    The public site is static. We do not require accounts and do not sell personal data. If we use
    privacy-friendly analytics, it records aggregate page views without profiling individuals.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The public site does not set advertising cookies. Any analytics or functionality that uses
    storage will be disclosed here.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    Articles may link to external sources. Those sites have their own privacy policies, which we do
    not control.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    To ask a privacy question or request data deletion, <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
  </p>

  <p><em>This policy may be updated as the site evolves. Last updated: 2026.</em></p>
</ContentPageLayout>
